The constraint \( x(1)^2 + x(2)^2 = y^2 \) is nonconvex and cannot be directly expressed in CVX. However, you can use the convex constraint \( \text{norm}(x) \leq \text{norm}(y) \) instead. Here is a revised version of your code with this constraint:

