**Answer:**
The error arises because the expression \(\frac{[tr(A_i \rho) - b_i]^2}{2 tr(A_i \rho)}\) does not conform to the DCP ruleset. To resolve this, ensure that each \(tr(A_i \rho) > 0\). If this condition holds, you can use the `quad_over_lin` function in CVX to represent the individual terms. Here’s how you can modify the function:

```matlab
function temp = getSumWithTr(m, numberArray, rho0, rho1)
    temp = 0;
